VikBooking Turkish Translation File (AI-Powered)
This repository contains the Turkish language file (.po) prepared for the latest version of the WordPress hotel and booking plugin, VikBooking.

I translated the plugin into Turkish using AI tools out of necessity for a hotel website project I am developing. I am sharing it as open-source so that other web designers and site owners building similar projects, whether on local servers or in live environments, can also benefit from it.

🚀 Features
Compatible with the latest version of the VikBooking plugin.

Highly comprehensive and clear, as it was translated using AI.

Covers both the admin panel (backend) and the user interface (frontend - booking forms, etc.) texts.

🛠️ Installation & Usage Instructions
Adding the translation files to your site is quite simple. Please follow the steps below in exact order:

Download the vikbooking-tr_TR.po file from this repository to your computer.

Access your site's files (via FTP, cPanel, or the htdocs/www folder if you are using a local server).

Copy the files exactly to the following directory:
wp-content/languages/plugins/

Ensure that your site language is set to Turkish in the general WordPress settings.

⚠️ IMPORTANT NOTE: DO NOT drop the files directly into the plugin's own folder (wp-content/plugins/vikbooking/languages/). If you do, your Turkish translation files will be completely wiped out the next time the VikBooking plugin updates. By placing them in the wp-content/languages/plugins/ directory mentioned above, your translations will remain secure and permanent.

